# .trivyignore — accepted Trivy findings for this repo (ADR-014 item 4).
#
# Each non-comment, non-blank line is ONE Trivy finding id that CI will ignore:
#   * a vulnerability id      e.g. CVE-2024-12345
#   * a misconfiguration id   e.g. AVD-DS-0002
#   * a secret rule id        e.g. aws-access-key-id
#
# Empty by design: nothing is accepted yet. Adding a line is a deliberate,
# reviewed risk acceptance — record WHY in the commit message (and, for anything
# non-trivial, in an ADR). Do not add blanket wildcards.
